        "TileImage": "$($repository f911d7ee-169d-4cfe-9a77-b0d28177e3f0).Image",
        "Description": "Twins, Alex and Irina,  are  identical in almost every way.  From childood they used their similarity to play tricks.\r\rOrphaned in a mysterious yachting accident, the twins were left their parents fortune and no-one alive who could tell them apart. Swapping identities,  jobs and lovers at will, they love to play twisted games for amusement and profit. \r\rThese twisted twins came into this world within minutes of each other. It&apos;s time they left the same way.",
